# Throwaway probes. Measuring something in the live app means a little CDP script, and those
# live at the root while I am using them — two of them (`pulizia.mjs`, `titolo.mjs`) rode into
# the repository on a `git add -A` and were spotted by somebody reading the file list, which is
# not the review step this deserves. Root-level only: `scripts/record.mjs` is real.
/*.mjs
/*.probe.py
